# Live copy on GitHub

The live version is the `main` branch at https://github.com/julianholtom-sys/CONTRACTS (remote `origin`). Open that on another machine. Do not keep a newer copy only on this computer.

Before editing, pull `origin main` and continue from it.

After each meaningful project-file change, commit and push `main` to `origin` before moving on. Do not wait until the whole task is finished.

1. Leave out secrets: `.env`, credentials, tokens, and private keys.
2. Push to `origin` (`github.com/julianholtom-sys/CONTRACTS`). That remote is the live one. Track it.
3. The Cursor-hosted copy (`origin.cursor.com/julian-holtom/attest`, remote `cursor`) is retired. It stopped at commit `f5ec4f1` on 19 Oct 2026. Do not push to it or treat it as current unless the user asks.
4. Do not force-push. Do not change the git user name or email.
